WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.840
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.820
The judging of the batter competition has begun.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:16.850
closed captions

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.280
