00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.290
François wins!

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.290
Team François takes the initial lead!

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.640
Why'd you roll out the batter so thin the butter came out?

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.840
You know that you can't make that batter any thinner than 6 millimeters!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.430
I'm sorry...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.040
I thought the only way I could beat François was to make the crust extremely thin.

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:46.430
To win against a feuilletage inversé, you had no choice but to try that.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:50.540
I think the courage you showed in attempting it was quite impressive, Amano-san.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:53.320
Andou-kun, thank you.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.800
Ichigo, we haven't lost yet!

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.120
The Sweets Princes will definitely make a comeback!

