00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:41.450
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:54.450
So you used the azuki beans grown in Hokkaido you brought with you in this anko...

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.070
Andou-kun's been in top form ever since we got to Paris.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.230
No way! I lost?

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:08.050
And he defeated Katie in the croissant batter competition.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.050
Andou!

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.060
But...

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:16.550
Hanabusa-kun lost to Isabella in the succès batter battle.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:21.580
Hanabusa-kun, it's really a shame.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:29.170
Using French meringue is more in style than Italian meringue for macarons in Europe right now.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:32.750
Now, Team François is up 2 to 1!

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:39.610
The path to victory lies through the choux batter battle between my darling Kashino Makoto-kun and Dominique Darrieux!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:46.710
A praline almond and bitter chocolate cream, huh?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.120
As opposed to this...

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:57.800
Did you, perhaps, put yuzu in this lemon cream base?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.420
And by gently combining it with the almond cream...

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.960
It's truly a completely new taste he has created.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.640
Yes.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.810
All right!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.350
Perfect!

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.010
Wonderful, Makoto-kun!

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.250
Ojou-sama!

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.090
Hey! You're the reporter, Ojou!

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.360
Do your job already!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.000
We ended up in another tie!

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.400
I can hardly breathe...

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.060
I can't watch!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:36.380
After all this, shouldn't they just let both teams win?

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:45.720
We have considered declaring both teams winners,

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.550
but we need to decide a winner and a loser.

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.560
The final rematch will be between a single representative from both teams.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:58.560
Will each team please decide on their representative.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:02.490
We will begin after a one hour break.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:09.600
recipe 50

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:09.600
Dream Strawberry Tart

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.430
Everyone, thank you for entrusting this to me.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:18.440
I could not have predicted this match would continue for so long...

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.960
I'll give it everything I have.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:28.590
No matter who their representative is, I will show everyone that I'm Henri-sensei's number one pupil.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.530
So one person will represent us?

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:34.960
I guess it has to be Kashi-

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.160
I think you should do it, Amano.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.640
Me!?

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:45.720
I can't do that! Not after screwing up like I did in the last round...

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.810
No...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:51.600
For the pie batter battle, in order to compete with a feuilletage inversé...

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:56.160
I admire your quick thinking in trying to make the crust thinner and your challenger spirit.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:02.980
And I think we've come this far because you've brought us so close together, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:07.610
Also, it's almost certain that François will be the representative from the other team.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:13.450
If it's François, I suspect that she'll bring out her Dijonaise au Chocolat, that's been chosen as a Kingdom of Sweets Court Recipe.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.730
The only thing that could beat that...

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:19.340
...is your original strawberry tart, Amano-san.

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:20.170
Yeah.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:24.880
You have an overflowing imagination and palate that we lack, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.090
Try pushing them to their limits,

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:30.990
and create your own strawberry tart that surpasses your grandmothers!

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:32.920
Kashino...

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.220
Hanabusa-kun...

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:35.840
Andou-kun...

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:38.100
You believe in me that much?

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:39.700
Then, it's decided!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:42.370
Team Ichigo's representative will be: Ichigo!

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.070
Agreed!

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.360
You don't agree, Chocolat?

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:51.180
Well, if that's what everyone else decides, then it can't be helped.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.600
Thank you, everyone!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:07:02.200
As your representative, I will create a strawberry tart with everything I've got with no regrets!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.170
Ichigo, lucky you!

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.710
They've got fraise des bois!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:13.530
Yeah!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.870
I can make grandma's strawberry tart with these,

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.870
but to make a new strawberry tart...

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:27.700
Oh, yeah! That crisp texture I got when I ate that jam at Blanc-san's...

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:30.450
What was that again?

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:34.510
I'm pretty sure it was next to the lemon jam...

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.430
Umm... I think it was...

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.580
Rhubarb!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:44.940
All right!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:48.440
I want to do something with the sugar, too...

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:57.160
Brown sugar?

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:59.580
That's...

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.170
Oh, Ichigo... What's the matter?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:10.630
I'm sorry... I spilled the brown powder...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.560
Oh, you spilled the sugar.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:18.040
It's okay, don't cry.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:21.970
It's brown... but it's sugar?

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:24.460
Yes, it is.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.630
Yeah! It's sweet!

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:34.130
Normal white sugar is made from sugar cane.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:34.840
Sugar cane

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:41.140
This vergeoise is made from a plant called a sugar beet, which makes it brown.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:40.810
Sugar beet

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:42.450
Ver... Ver...

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:46.080
Vergeoise.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:51.400
If you use this, your sweets will bake up moist and delicious.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.860
That taste from back then!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.970
Vergeoise! I'm sure that's what my grandmother said!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:03.850
But she didn't use it for her strawberry tart.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.480
Okay, let's use it!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.110
Ichigo, I'd like to start the match now, if you don't mind.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.740
Sorry! I'm coming right away!

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:15.860
Oopsie...

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.680
Corn meal?

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.950
You will have 3 hours to cook.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:29.680
Now... Start the match!

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:50.930
She beat Tennouji-san... She's just too incredible...

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:53.410
The difference between me and her is so...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:58.040
Ichigo, what's the matter? You've got to hurry and start!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.030
Right!

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.860
What the heck is she doing?

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.860
She's way too nervous!

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:08.270
Ichigo, relax!

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.220
Ichigo, calm down!

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:16.310
Yeah...

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:19.300
I'll clean this up here, so keep going!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.450
I'm sorry, Vanilla.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:22.470
Amano-san.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.260
Calm down.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:30.180
It's not just technique that's needed to create new sweets.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:36.900
You need to be highly sensitive to the happiness of those around you, and have an originality to make something no one has ever dreamed of.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:43.910
You have that ability. That's why everyone has watched over you so warmly.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:46.910
Have confidence in yourself, and stand tall.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:50.420
Tennouji-san...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.300
Tennouji-san's right.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:03.140
For the sake of all the people who've helped me grow...

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.520
I'll make it by putting in all my feelings of thanks.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:32.150
As we thought, François is making her Dijonaise au Chocolat.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.350
You can do it, Amano-san.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.840
Don't worry. Ichigo-chan will win, for sure!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.360
Henri-sensei...

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:07.370
I will win, no matter what, and help with your new project under your tutelage.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:17.240
Why is Amano making all those different rhubarb confitures?

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:20.550
If you do that, then you will run out of time.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.160
No, this is Amano-san we're talking about.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.710
I think she must have some plan.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.260
Let's believe in Ichigo-chan.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:04.510
François is already putting on the finishing glaçage!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.710
But Amano-san's strawberry tart hasn't finished baking yet!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:11.710
Can one even finish a strawberry tart in the time that is left?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:15.480
I mean... Is this really gonna work out okay?

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:23.400
Finished!

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:30.950
Yay~

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:34.620
To everyone watching from around the world...

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:39.300
It's time to finally decide the rematch for the finals of the World Cake Grand Prix!

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:49.580
The representatives of Team François and Team Ichigo's battle will decide the winner!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.500
Please, enjoy.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.990
This is...

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:15.950
The cassis liqueur harmonises with the peppered crème brûlée...

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:20.850
No... That's not all...

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:25.830
The crispy pain au chocolat also has numerous spices in it.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:32.390
It's such a complex, deep flavour that delights my taste buds in ways I can't even describe.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:37.520
The judging seems to be completed!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.080
What is the score for François's Dijonaise au Chocolat?

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:54.770
To get a 98 from such a harsh critic as Henri-sensei is...

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:58.320
498 points!?

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:00.810
That's basically flawless.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:05.790
I suppose we should expect as much from the leader of the team representing the Paris campus.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:09.510
If it's like this then, unless a miracle happens, we'll never win.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.550
That's not true!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.050
Caramel...

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:17.040
Ichigo worked so hard!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:20.210
I just know a miracle will happen! I just know it!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.560
I also believe a miracle will happen.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.520
I'm sorry, take this one.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.020
What incredible luster!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.410
I see... So she used vergeoise...

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:56.050
Now, please have some of my strawberry tart.

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:03.780
This is...

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.270
I've never eaten anything like this...

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.980
It's a completely new flavour and sensation!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.660
These two crispy textures in my mouth...

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.870
Corn meal and... rhubarb?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.910
Everyone, how is it?

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.440
Is it delicious? Or disgusting?

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:31.860
I'm in a state of bliss!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.430
I've never experienced anything like it before!

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:41.930
The tastes of the ingredients are combined to perfection!

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:49.100
It's like I'm flying, carefree, above a field of fraise des bois strawberries!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:55.600
Unbelievable! An entirely new sweet is born!

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:05.830
Ichigo... It seems my eyes did not deceive me after all...

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.940
The judging looks like it has been completed.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:14.000
What score can Amano-san's...

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.630
Amano-san's...

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.880
Hey, Amano-san!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.760
Just calling it a "strawberry tart" is boring.

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:25.110
Don't you have some fancier sounding name?

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.410
Don't ask me that out of the blue!

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:31.000
Ichigo, can I name it?

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.510
Sure... Okay...

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:37.720
How about "Sourire de l'Ange", Angel's Smile?

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:41.250
Angel's Smile? That sounds wonderful!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.520
Okay...

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:47.870
What are the scores for Amano-san's Sourire de l'Ange?

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:02.290
T-That's...

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:07.850
Vanilla...

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:11.280
This isn't a dream... Right?

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.020
Of course not!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:15.700
Ow.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:17.770
Which means...

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:19.990
It's not a dream!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:20.810
Yup!

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.930
I won't accept this!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:25.720
Why...

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.640
Why did I have to lose?

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.890
François...

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:37.220
You are definitely superior when it comes to technique.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:43.720
But Ichigo's Sourire de l'Ange was so incredible it overcame that.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:51.230
Her invention of using corn meal and rhubarb to produce an original texture,

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:57.900
and her consideration to make each tart individually to the tastes of each judge...

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:00.170
Oh? Let me see.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:06.130
It is definitely less sweet than the one I had.

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.410
Sweet... This one is quite sweet, yes.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:15.920
I see! So that's why she made each of the five rhubarb confiture separately!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.090
On the other hand,

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:24.000
you were content with your already perfected Dijonaise au Chocolat

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.930
and created nothing new.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:29.130
Due to your complete arrogance!

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:34.230
Result: the winner is Team Ichigo!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.030
We did it!

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:45.740
Ichigo-chan really did it!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.000
Yay! Yay!

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:33.000
Thank you, everyone!

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.750
Congratulations, Ichigo.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:42.460
But this is just the beginning. Good luck!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.850
Umm... I heard from Sully-san and the others.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:16.820
That you purposefully took on the role of the bad guy...

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:20.320
So that I could surpass my grandma...

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:21.120
Ichigo.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.640
What do you think about the sweets world today?

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:29.050
I believe the world of sweets has stagnated.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:34.540
All it is doing is arranging sweets that have already been perfected.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:38.580
I wanted to discover new genius young talent

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:44.130
that could blow a fresh wind into that world with their original creations.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:45.760
That's...

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:52.120
That's your grandmother when she studied in Paris, and my grandfather who was her mentor.

00:21:52.630 --> 00:22:01.520
I intend to train you just like my grandfather trained your grandmother during your studies here in Paris.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:04.820
Right!

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:14.280
K-Kashino...

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:18.480
I won't say it now.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:23.200
We still have so much left to learn.

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:24.750
Yeah.

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:30.090
It's the same for me. So I won't say it now either.

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:35.930
Well, the three of us will go back to Japan first.

00:22:36.490 --> 00:22:41.130
Yeah. I'll be back next week.

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:48.270
I'm sure brand new days await us there.

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:57.790
Yumeiro Pâtissière was brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:22:57.790 --> 00:22:59.110
There's more to come!

00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:02.800
Dream-coloured Magical Essence!

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:06.730
This time, since we're dubbing the game, we'll introduce all the voice actors!

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:09.570
Amano Ichigo role
(Yuuki Aoi)

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:19.120
Dubbing Recording Scene

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.790
Do you want to eat my dream-coloured sweets?

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.700
Kashino Makoto role
(Okamoto Nobuhiko)

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:12.770
Amano, you did well.

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:15.790
Andou Sennosuke role
(Hamazoe Shinya)

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:15.900
Amano-san, you did great.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:19.120
Hanabusa Satsuki role
(Yonaga Tsubasa)

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.190
Ichigo-chan, you did it.

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:35.600
On the topic of Yumeiro Pâtissiére so far and after developments...

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.600
I think that the most important feature in this 50th episode is the mindset of always trying one's best,

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:26.330
which I think has really shown results, or something like that.

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:26.330
Ah, yeah, that's true.

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:29.720
So, from now on, I suppose they'll want to see how it actually feels to be a professional?

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:30.940
Ahh, that's right!

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:33.590
More like a real pâtissier... which would be tough.

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.590
Yes, yes, really.

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:35.730
Just how it actually feels to be a pâtissier.

00:23:35.730 --> 00:23:40.660
And above all, let's work hard and take special classes to make even more sweets!

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:41.150
Yeah!

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:41.150
Alright!

00:23:41.150 --> 00:23:41.690
Let's work hard!

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:55.990
A message to the audience
about the new series

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:45.370
I'd like to work hard to bring everyone these sparkling feelings!

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:49.650
I'd like to work hard for a position in which I can put more effort into work!

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:52.900
I'd like to work hard to bring and give everyone a joyful feeling!

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:55.990
I'll work hard to bring everyone perfect dream-coloured sweets.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.620
Well then, everyone look forward to...

00:23:58.620 --> 00:23:59.870
...the new series!

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:03.310
My studies abroad in Paris are over, and I've come back to Japan!

00:24:03.310 --> 00:24:05.670
Starting today, I'm a first year in high school!

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:06.780
Let's do it!

00:24:07.730 --> 00:24:10.290
But, there's no one else here...

00:24:11.170 --> 00:24:12.650
I don't wanna!

00:24:12.650 --> 00:24:14.300
We'll only be apart for a bit...

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:18.230
And it's something they decided for themselves. There's nothing we can do about it.

00:24:18.230 --> 00:24:20.810
Next episode, Team Ichigo Breaks Up!

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:23.800
Do you want to eat my dream-coloured sweets?

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:25.060
Next episode

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:25.060
Marie's garden

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:25.060
